          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "వడగాలి (vaḍagāli) is native Dravidian: DEDR 5225 lists Telugu vaḍa, \"heat\", and vaḍagāli, \"the hot or land wind\"."
            }
          ]
        },
