              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): ఎండిపోయింది, eṇḍipōyindi."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఎండు, to dry in the sun, + పోవు. Said of ponds, plants and throats. Its subject is a thing, so the past shown is the third person: ఎండిపోయింది, it dried up."
